+
+# Implement createPatch
+
+Export `createPatch(from, to)` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Returns a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) that, applied to `from` with `applyPatch`, gives `to`.
+- Describes only what changed: objects are diffed member by member, arrays element by element
+  (unchanged head and tail skipped); deeply equal documents give `[]`.
+- Neither input is mutated, and values in the patch are copies.
+- Member names are escaped in paths (`~0`, `~1`); `__proto__` is plain data.
+
+## Outcome
+
+Implemented in `src/index.ts`, tested in `src/index.test.ts` (minimal patches, escaping, round trips
+through `applyPatch`, immutability); `npm test` passes.
